WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
Dhalsim catches Ryu for the down throw shown by the source overlay.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.500
The throw sends Ryu to the floor at the corner.

3
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:02.880
Dhalsim releases a light fireball while Ryu is getting up.

4
00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:03.900
Ryu blocks the light fireball as he rises in the corner.

5
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.600
Dhalsim and the cornered opponent return to standing after the blocked fireball.
